{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-altissima","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"altissima","about":"Discover the pinnacle of eco-friendly luxury at Altissima Al Barari, a jewel in Dubai's crown. Inspired by the enchanting 'tree of heaven', this green paradise is the last chapter in the Al Barari saga, setting a new standard in sustainable living. Each of the magical 7-bedroom villas at Altissima Al Barari has been meticulously designed to offer an unrivaled blend of elegance and environmental consciousness. As a resident, you'll enjoy a life of unparalleled luxury and wellness, surrounded by lush landscapes and tranquil waterways. Altissima Al Barari is not just a place to stay; it's a lifestyle. Crafted for individuals seeking a comprehensive and sustainable lifestyle, this botanical sanctuary effortlessly harmonizes the elements of nature with opulent living. It serves as a haven where you can play, work, dine and shop.Residents can maintain their active lifestyle at Altissima, thanks to the four Padel Courts, a Bowling Alley, Billiards, and Table Tennis in the complex. They can enjoy some pampering at the world-class retreat featuring massage rooms, saunas, ice baths, pools, hammams, full-service hair, and much more. Alternatively, sip a delicious cup of coffee at the cozy Café.This verdant retreat in the heart of Dubai offers everything from shopping and dining to leisure and work opportunities, all within an eco-conscious and wellness-enhancing environment. Al Barari, meaning 'wilderness' in Arabic, is a trailblazer in integrated luxury and sustainable development.","price":40000000,"title":"Altissima","bitrix":{"id":325,"pf_id":"are.2.13865","source":null,"project_id":"Altissima","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Altissima","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Al Barari","project_location":"Al Barari"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.ne